  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Humanitarian Partnership (Global) 2022/23 - 2024/2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Humanitarian (TNH) is a news agency that reports on humanitarian crises and delivers humanitarian insights to inform policy and practitioners. The partnership supports TNH to cover humanitarian issues that are often neglected by the mainstream media. TNH&#x2019;s research and learning will contribute evidence to inform Australia&#x2019;s humanitarian policy and practice. The funding will also support TNH to continue to report on policy issues that align with Australia&#x2019;s humanitarian priorities, including protection of the most vulnerable, GEDSI, localisation, collective action and operationalising the humanitarian &#x2013;development &#x2013; peace nexus.</narrative>
  </description>
